 "title": "Telomere Maintenance and Metabolism in Yeast and Drosophila",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around the maintenance of telomeres in yeast and the accumulation of certain metabolites in yeast and Drosophila. Telomere maintenance involves genes such as SUL1, Sam1, and Y', which are amplified by pol32 and yku70. The accumulation of Hcy and SAH in yeast and Drosophila is linked to telomere maintenance. Additionally, the metabolism of AdoMet and glucose is connected to Sam1 and stress granules. The cluster also includes the involvement of Telomere in mmBIR and the requirement of pol32 and yku70 for mmBIR.",
